8
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:23,200
Happy holidays, happy holidays

9
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:25,500
What a glorious time of year!

10
00:04:25,500 --> 00:04:30,800
すやすやと眠る子供達の手に
In the hands of peacefully sleeping children,

11
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:36,000
抱かれたテディベアもしもう待ちきれない
even the hugged teddy bears can't wait any longer.

12
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:41,200
クリスマスが今年もやって来る
Christmas is coming again this year,

13
