19
00:05:18,188 --> 00:05:23,688
Happy holidays,happy holidays What a glorious time of year!
Happy holidays, happy holidays! What a glorious time of year!

20
00:05:23,988 --> 00:05:28,988
大切なものはみんなそばにある
Everything that's precious is right by your side.

21
